{"_data": [{"contents": [{"content": "The Environment", "type": "lesson_name"}, {"content": "The Endangered Species", "type": "unit_name"}, {"content": 9, "type": "position"}, {"content": "stub", "type": "origin"}, {"content": 2, "type": "lesson"}, {"content": "B2.1", "type": "level"}], "type": "metadata"}, {"contents": [{"content": "false", "type": "test"}], "type": "achievment_test"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Describe social, urban and environmental change in written and spoken situations according to work and social contexts.", "type": "primary"}, {"content": "Understands general and detailed information as well as attitude and intention on a wide range of general and work topics, in conversations or presentations, spoken at a natural speed and in circumstances that make it more difficult to hear. ", "type": "secondary_1"}, {"content": "Understands general and detailed information as well as attitude and intention on a wide range of general and work topics, in conversations or presentations, spoken at a natural speed and in circumstances that make it more difficult to hear. ", "type": "secondary_2"}, {"content": " Integrates a wider range of written and spoken language skills and knowledge when dealing with problems and difficulties in the workplace. ", "type": "secondary_3"}, {"content": "Understands general and detailed information as well as attitude and intention on a wide range of general and work topics, in conversations or presentations, spoken at a natural speed and in circumstances that make it more difficult to hear. ", "type": "secondary_4"}, {"content": "Understands general and detailed information as well as attitude and intention on a wide range of general and work topics, in conversations or presentations, spoken at a natural speed and in circumstances that make it more difficult to hear. ", "type": "secondary_5"}, {"content": "Understands general and detailed information as well as attitude and intention on a wide range of general and work topics, in conversations or presentations, spoken at a natural speed and in circumstances that make it more difficult to hear. ", "type": "secondary_6"}, {"content": " Understands general and detailed information as well as attitude and intention on a wide range of general and work topics, in conversations or presentations, spoken at a natural speed and in circumstances that make it more difficult to hear. ", "type": "secondary_7"}, {"content": "Integrates a wider range of written and spoken language skills and knowledge when dealing with problems and difficulties in the workplace. ", "type": "secondary_8"}], "type": "objectives"}, {"contents": [{"content": "The Passive: The Present Continuous and Present Perfect Tenses", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "<p>You use the Present Continuous to talk about an action that is happening at the time of speaking. The action or event is in progress. <br/><span class=\"italic\">Across the world, species <span class=\"strong\">are disappearing</span> at an astonishing rate.</span></p><p>You use the Present Perfect to talk about a finished action or event with present consequences. There is a connection between what happened in the past and the present.<br/><span class=\"italic\">Making laws to protect these endangered animals <span class=\"strong\">has been</span> the focus of many eco-groups. </span></p>", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "You often choose the passive form when you want to talk about an action but are not so interested in saying who or what does/did it. Passives without <span class=\"italic\">agents</span> (the doers) are common in academic and scientific writing. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Look at the chart below for the structure of the passive voice.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":4,\"columns\":3,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Name\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Structure\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Example\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Present Continuous\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">am</span>/<span class=\\\"italic\\\">are</span>/<span class=\\\"italic\\\">is</span> +  <span class=\\\"italic\\\">being </span>+ past participle\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">These products are being sold in markets around the world. </span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Present Perfect\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">have</span>/<span class=\\\"italic\\\">has</span> + <span class=\\\"italic\\\">been </span>+ past participle\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">In many countries, endangered animals have been hunted for their valuable pelts, feathers, or meat. </span>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}", "type": "table"}, {"content": "Immediate action has been taken to protect the last population of many endangered species. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "Many countries have made laws to prohibit the hunting or killing of endangered animals. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "An increasing number of different genuses of birds, fish, and land animals are being declared extinct every year.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "These products are being sold in markets around the world. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "So many of the animals have been killed that they are not able to reproduce quickly enough to continue the species.", "type": "example"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Conditional Sentences", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "There are four types of conditional sentences in English:<ol><li>Zero Conditional - to talk about certainty and facts</li><li>First Conditional - to talk about real possibilities in the present or the future</li><li>Second Conditional - to talk about things that are not possible or not likely to happen in the present or the future</li><li>Third Conditional - to talk about things that happened or did not happen in the past that you regret</li></ol>", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "You use the third conditional to talk about the past. These are things that  were not real or did not happen in the past. You often use the third conditional to express regret.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Look at the chart below to compare the structure of each kind of conditional:", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":6,\"columns\":3,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<div class=\\\"center_text\\\">Conditional Name</div>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<div class=\\\"center_text\\\">Structure</div>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<div class=\\\"center_text\\\">Example</div>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Zero \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">If</span> + Simple Present, Simple Present\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">If you <span class=\\\"strong\\\">heat</span> ice, it <span class=\\\"strong\\\">melts</span>.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"First\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">If</span> + Simple Present, <span class=\\\"italic\\\">will</span> + Simple Present\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">If we <span class=\\\"strong\\\">lose</span> more species, what <span class=\\\"strong\\\">will be</span> the environmental cost?</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Second\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">If</span> + Simple Past, <span class=\\\"italic\\\">would</span> + Simple Present\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">If <span class=\\\"strong\\\">we were</span> to pollute and hunt less, <span class=\\\"strong\\\">would we see</span> an immediate turn around?   </span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Third\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">If</span> + Past Perfect, <span class=\\\"italic\\\">would have</span> + past participle\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">If humans <span class=\\\"strong\\\">had been</span> more aware of wildlife preservation in the past, so many species <span class=\\\"strong\\\">wouldn't have become</span> endangered.</span>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}", "type": "table"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"content": "astonishing ", "type": "name"}, {"content": " so surprising that it is difficult to believe, alarming", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Species are disappearing at an astonishing rate.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn9le02ob09aud01", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": " These are words you use to talk about the species extinction.", "type": "text"}], "type": "target_word_describer"}, {"contents": [{"content": "genera", "type": "name"}, {"content": "the general groups or classes that animals or plants are divided into", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: An increasing number of different genera of birds, fish, and land animals are being declared extinct every year.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn9le02ob09aud02", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "to declare", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to say, state, or announce that something is true", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Scientists have had to declare the extinction of a number of species.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn9le02ob09aud03", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "remaining ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "left when others have gone, been used, or been dealt with", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Eco-groups work to keep the last remaining animals of a species alive.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn9le02ob09aud04", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "to reproduce", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to produce new, young living beings", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: So many of the animals have been killed that they are not able to reproduce quickly enough.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn9le02ob09aud05", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "pelt ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "the skin of a dead animal, especially with the fur or hair still on it", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Endangered animals have been hunted for their valuable pelts, feathers, or meat.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn9le02ob09aud06", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "deforestation ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "the cutting or burning down of all the trees in an area", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: There are also laws against deforestation.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn9le02ob09aud07", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "sympathetic ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "willing to give approval and support to an aim or plan", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Not everyone is sympathetic to the cause.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn9le02ob09aud08", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Go online or visit the library to find out which species are endangered in your country.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Prepare a report about the kind of animal, why it has become endangered and what can be done about it.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Share your reports with a classmate/partner. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Discuss the issue of endangered species in your country.", "type": "text"}], "type": "takeaway_extension"}, {"contents": [{"content": "I identify endangered species in my country.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I write about environmental issues in my country.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I discuss the issue of endangered species with a partner.", "type": "text"}], "type": "takeaway_assessment"}, {"content": "engenn9le02ob09re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}], "labs": [{"stimuli": [{"template_override": 1, "contents": [{}], "_data": [], "id": 0, "type": "welcome"}, {"template_override": 1, "_data": [], "title": "", "type": "audio", "contents": [{"value": {"images": [{"image": "engenn9le02ob09re2img01.jpg", "time": "0", "id": 0, "text": ""}, {"image": "engenn9le02ob09re2img01.jpg", "time": "100", "id": 1, "text": "Across the world, species are disappearing at an astonishing rate. An increasing number of different genera of birds, fish, and land animals are being declared extinct every year. Making laws to protect these endangered animals has been the focus of many eco-groups. They work to keep the last remaining animals of a species alive."}, {"image": "engenn9le02ob09re2img02.jpg", "time": "22000", "id": 2, "text": "Many species have been put in danger of extinction thanks to the activities of human beings. If humans had been more aware of wildlife preservation in the past, so many species wouldn't have become endangered. In many countries, endangered animals have been hunted for their valuable pelts, feathers, or meat. These products are being sold in markets around the world. So many of the animals have been killed that they are not able to reproduce quickly enough to continue the species."}, {"image": "engenn9le02ob09re2img03.jpg", "time": "53000", "id": 3, "text": "Environmental groups around the world have made us more aware of our behavior. Immediate action has to be taken to protect the last population of many endangered species. Many countries have made laws to prohibit the hunting or killing of endangered animals. There are also laws against deforestation - the permanent destruction of forests.<br/>\nUnfortunately, not everyone is sympathetic to the cause. Many continue to destroy forests, pollute waters, and hunt wild animals for profit. These questions remain: If we lose more species, what will be the environmental cost? If we were to pollute and hunt less, would we see an immediate turn around? If we want answers to these questions, we must act, and act quickly."}], "audiosrc": "engenn9le02ob09re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn9le02ob09re2img01.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}], "id": 1}], "exercises": [{"template_override": 1, "_data": [{"contents": [{"content": " I can talk about things that are happening and things that have happened. ", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " I can talk about cause and effect, and hypothetical situations.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": "What endangered species are there in your country? ", "type": "Free Header Item"}, {"content": "Why is it important to save them?", "type": "Free Header Item"}, {"content": " I can describe environmental problems.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}], "type": "instructions"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Welcome", "type": "group_name"}], "type": "group"}, {"content": {"attempt_feedback": [{"content": "You have 2 tries", "type": "text"}, {"content": "you have 1 attempt left", "type": "text"}], "incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "try again", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next time", "type": "text"}], "correct_feedback": "Correct", "allowed_attempts": 2}, "type": "feedback"}, {"content": "Ask your partner:", "type": "free_header_text"}, {"content": "Humans have caused harm to many species.", "type": "free_type_text_area"}], "questions": [], "type": "WLC", "id": 0, "img_path": "", "stimuli_ids": [0]}, {"template_override": 1, "_data": [{"contents": [{"content": "What has been the focus on <span class=\"tool-tip\" id=\"tip_1_0\">eco</span>-groups in the world? ", "type": "text"}], "type": "instructions"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Content", "type": "group_name"}], "type": "group"}, {"content": {"attempt_feedback": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}, {"content": "", "type": "text"}], "incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "Whoops! Something important is missing.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next time...", "type": "text"}], "correct_feedback": "Correct!", "allowed_attempts": 2}, "type": "feedback"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Listening", "type": "skill"}, {"content": "Reading", "type": "skill"}], "type": "learning_skills"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Instructions: Click on the play button to listen to the audio.", "type": "text"}], "type": "post_instructions"}, {"content": [{"content": "<span class=\"italic\">\"Eco\"</span> is a prefix which represents ecology - the political movement that seeks to protect the environment, especially from pollution.", "tip_id": 0, "type": "text"}], "type": "tips"}], "questions": [{"_data": [{"contents": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}], "type": "question"}], "id": 0, "responses": [{"correct": 0, "selected": 0, "_data": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}], "id": 0}, {"correct": 1, "selected": 0, "_data": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}], "id": 1}]}], "type": "STI", "id": 1, "stimuli_ids": [1]}, {"template_override": 1, "_data": [{"contents": [{"content": " \nWhat environmental vocabulary do you know?\n", "type": "text"}], "ty